BAUX daemon service for mesh coordination and service discovery.

bauxd provides a REST API on port 9999 for BAUX mesh operations including:
- Session discovery and management
- Service coordination across BAUX nodes
- File synchronization primitives
- Health monitoring and status reporting

This service enables proper distributed BAUX functionality and replaces
ad-hoc SSH-based approaches with a clean, extensible API.

